# npm does NOT read .gitignore for a file that a `files` entry pulled in, so the preview
# output has to be excluded a second time here.
#
# `package.json` ships the whole `tools/` directory on purpose: `preview.mjs`,
# `build-client.mjs` and `check-width-live.mjs` are the reason a contributor can SEE the
# panel and re-measure it, and they are a few KB. What must not ship is their OUTPUT —
# `preview.html` and two ~300KB PNGs, regenerated per machine and per Chrome build.
tools/preview.html
tools/preview-*.png

# The width harness writes its screenshot next to itself when run by hand.
tools/width-*.png
